  "releaseNotes": "Implement ARC WR RO-Crate profile\nAdditions:\nadd ARC wr ro crate model (WIP)\nadd formal parameter\nadd computational workflow\nadd software source code profile\nadd createaction\nadd workflowprotocol\nadd ARCWorkflow to Dataset\nadd arcrun\nadd workflowinvocation\nimplement first approach to conversion of Workflow object\nrename CWL Description to ProcessingUnit and add parsers\nadd CWLProcessingUnit as property to ArcRun and ArcWorkflow\ninclude cwl files in ARC Scaffold parsing\nadd workflow and run cwl parsing tests\nadd CWLParameterReference type\nadd YAML parameter file parsing\nadd direct parameterfile decode function\nadd cwl yml input parameters to run object and arc parsing\nfirst version of parsing to arc-wr-ro-crate\nadd basic WR to RO-Crate conversion tests\nupdate rocrate workflow and run compose functions to include fs information\nvarious changes to ROCrate conversion of CWLInputs\nimprove cwl ro-crate conversion to include parameter types\nadd some cwl test objects and ro-crate conversion tests\nfinish up first batch of cwl ro-crate parser tests\nadd some basic ro-crate to scaffold workflow converter functions\nfinish first implementation to workflow ro-crate reader\nadd ArcWorkflow ROCrate Conversion tests\nfinish up first version of workflow and run ro-crate conversion and roundabout tests\nsome restructuring of the ro-crate types and conversion functions\nadd setup instructions and script for unix\nadd default programmingLanguages for RO-Crate export\nmake ldcontext resolove http and https as interchangeable\nupdate index.ts and rocrate.py\nDeletions:\nremove some unnecessary fields from ROCrate Workflow\nBugfixes:\nfix tests for dotnet sequences\nsome fixes and adjustments to JSON-LD base types\nfix and add formalparameter ro-crate conversion tests\nadd first cwlROCrate roundabout tests and according fixes\nadditional fixes towards Workflow Invocation conversion\nfix workflowinvcation writing test failing\nsmall fix to createAction URL and WorkflowInput additionalType\nfix FormalParameter lacking additional type property when being written\nfix ld context term resolving for compacted https insensitity\nupdate ro-crate context from1.2-DRAFT to 1.2 and fix bioschemas property urls\nfix test failing for updated ro-crate context",
